# Stone stair: twenty-two stone steps of 24 cm each spiralling up round the keep's drum, which stands at the origin, from the
# front (+z) round towards +x, up through the opening in the keep's ring to its top at 5.3 m. Each step is a block of stone 1.9 m
# deep standing on the ground, 30 cm apart on their middle line (38 degrees). The layout mirrors it for the second stair on the
# other side.
format 1
